#: ../../arguments/ignore-gsd.rst:9
msgid "ignore-gsd"
msgstr ""

#: ../../arguments/ignore-gsd.rst:13
msgid ""
"Ignore Ground Sampling Distance (GSD).A memory and processor hungry change "
"relative to the default behavior if set to true. Ordinarily, GSD estimates "
"are used to cap the maximum resolution of image outputs and resizes images "
"when necessary, resulting in faster processing and lower memory usage. Since "
"GSD is an estimate, sometimes ignoring it can result in slightly better "
"image output quality. Never set --ignore-gsd to true unless you are positive "
"you need it, and even then: do not use it. Default: ``False``"
msgstr ""

